: "Self-hosting with one docker compose up: server + PostgreSQL, VPS 2 cores / 2-4 GB, ~300-400 MB idle", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L31", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_server_implementation", "label": "Server implementation (stream server, 2026-10-25): rules beyond the contracts, status PROPOSED", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L37", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_login_sessions", "label": "Login and sessions (D-34): server stores Argon2id(loginKey)/Argon2id(recoveryLoginKey); fake deterministic salt for unknown email; device = session; JWT access 15 min carries userId + deviceId", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L41", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keys are already high-entropy (client did heavy Argon2id), so light server params m=19MiB t=2; equal timing for unknown emails prevents enumeration."}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_refresh_token_rotation", "label": "One-time refresh tokens (30 days) with rotation; reuse of a used token = theft, device revoked; password change revokes other devices, recovery revokes all", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L46", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_sync_seq_ordering", "label": "Sync rules: seq under doc row lock, ordered live delivery, idempotent push by clientMsgId; deviceId forms user / guest:<shareId>:<deviceId> / agent:<tokenId>; bad message -> protocol_mismatch", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L50", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_sync_limits", "label": "Sync limits: update 2 MB, snapshot 50 MB, awareness 64 KB, 100 msg/s per connection (burst x5)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L56", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_snapshots_versions", "label": "Snapshots made by clients (>500 updates or >1 MB), by server for agent notebooks; history versions = snapshots (GET /v1/docs/:id/versions)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L59", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_history_retention_policy", "label": "History retention policy: covered updates kept 7 days; snapshots - all for 7 days, daily to 30 days, weekly to 1 year, monthly after; HISTORY_* env", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L63", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Resolves R-05: lagging devices catch up with a small tail while DB growth stays bounded; subscribe sends snapshot + tail when updates are gone or >100."}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_sharing_guests", "label": "Sharing and guests (D-13, D-37): notebook share covers all its notes incl. future ones; guest token lives as long as the link; guests may upload attachments with edit but not delete; deleting a note/notebook revokes its links", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L67", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_agent_rls", "label": "Agents (D-30): token only for agent-mode notebooks; every agent request runs in a transaction under PostgreSQL role ds_agent with Row-Level Security; notebook key decrypted only inside it", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Even a buggy query cannot read or write another notebook."}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_background_jobs", "label": "Background jobs (pg-boss): doc-compact after new snapshot, cleanup hourly (deleted attachment files, abandoned uploads >7 d, expired tokens, revoked devices >30 d), history-sweep daily", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_trash", "label": "Trash: trashedAt encrypted in notebook index; after 30 days client calls DELETE /v1/docs/:id and server deletes doc, history, attachments immediately", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L83", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_spec_06_data_server_postgresql_drizzle", "target": "docs_decisions_0001_storage_in_database", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_spec_06_data_server_postgresql_drizzle", "target": "docs_decisions_0021_tech_stack", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_spec_06_data_server_postgresql_drizzle", "target": "docs_decisions_0030_server_database_postgresql", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_spec_06_data_server_crdt_block_tree", "target": "docs_decisions